            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick this unit and each friendly **Aggradon Lancers** unit wholly within 12&quot; of it to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the targets&apos; **Companion** weapons for the rest of the turn. In addition, place a **rage token** next to each target, to a maximum of 3 per unit.</characteristic>
