            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to hit rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **^^Saurus^^** or **^^Kroxigor^^** units that target an enemy unit while that enemy unit is within 9&quot; of this terrain feature.</characteristic>
