            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Ignore the first damage point that would be allocated to friendly **^^Saurus^^** and **^^Kroxigor^^** units each phase while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
